.TH AERO-DOCK 1 "November 2026" "Aero Linux v1.4.0" "Aero Linux Manual"
.SH NAME
aero-dock \- High-performance desktop application dock and task manager
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B aero-dock
[B\-\-positionR IPosR] [B\-\-autohideR] [B\-\-helpR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B aero-dock
is a native GTK3 application dock engineered for the Aero Linux desktop environment.
It provides hardware-accelerated icon animations, active window group indicators,
and desktop workspace switcher shortcuts.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BR \-p ", " \-\-position " " IPosR
Set dock screen edge position: bottom, top, left, or right (default: bottom).
.TP
.BR \-a ", " \-\-autohide
Enable intelligent window overlap auto-hiding.
.TP
.BR \-h ", " \-\-help
Display usage synopsis and exit.
